{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Bf37THpq6TmfUF5Lbd868r","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/meta_brain_lora_routing/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# meta_brain_lora_routing — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 16:59 UTC | 更新原因: Dream #1 结果处理 + plan 修复 + Phase 1 训练批准 (D007)\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nPerturbation-Adaptive LoRA Routing：从冻结 π₀ 内部激活诊断扰动类型，路由到专用 LoRA expert 做针对性修正。详见 `paper_framing.md`。\\\\n\\\\n## 目标会议\\\\nCoRL 2026 — Abstract DDL: 2026-05-26 (11天)，Paper DDL: 2026-05-29 (14天)\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims (from paper_framing.md)\\\\n1. **Perturbation Diagnosability** — 单层单 token 即可完美分类 (Phase 0 ✅)\\\\n2. **Targeted > Uniform Correction** — 扰动专用 LoRA > 通用 LoRA (Phase 1 进行中)\\\\n3. **Parameter-Efficient Robustness** — 12M vs rank-48 matched baseline (Phase 1 待验证)\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- 阶段：**Phase 1 LoRA Training** (已批准 D007)\\\\n- Dream #1 结果：4-5/10 Reject — 修复了 5 个结构性问题 → Re-dream 进行中\\\\n- Phase 1 代码：全部 dry-run 通过，4 路训练已批准启动\\\\n- 实验计划：15 个实验 (P0: 6, P1: 5, P2: 4)，230 GPU-hrs\\\\n\\\\n## Dream #1 修复项 (D007)\\\\n- [x] 加 plan_013: rank-48 parameter-matched universal LoRA (existential control)\\\\n- [x] 加 plan_014: rank sweep r=16/32/64 (capacity bottleneck test)\\\\n- [x] 加 plan_015: clean LIBERO eval (nominal preservation)\\\\n- [x] Random routing baseline 已在 plan_005\\\\n- [x] VLA-GSE comparison 降级为 suggestive\\\\n- [x] Contribution 合一，CM 降级为 ablation footnote\\\\n- [ ] Bibliography 扩到 30+ refs (写作阶段)\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] Phase 0 GO (D004) + complete_mvp\\\\n- [x] paper_framing.md + experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n- [x] Dream #1 → 修复 plan\\\\n- [ ] 4 路 LoRA 训练 (LoRA-V/S/P + Universal rank-16)\\\\n- [ ] rank-48 universal (plan_013, cuda:3 接力)\\\\n- [ ] Re-dream 回调处理 (dream_20260515T165902)\\\\n- [ ] Phase 1 assembly + eval (plan_003)\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 当前分配：4× RTX PRO 6000 96GB @ westd-34142\\\\n- 已用：~25 GPU-hrs (Phase 0)\\\\n- 计划：P0=115h, P1=50h, P2=65h = 230h (800h 等效容量内)\\\\n\\\\n## 架构决策 (Phase 0 → Phase 1)\\\\n- Router: PaliGemma layer 6, **first-token pooling** (D006, F1=1.0)\\\\n- LoRA: rank 16, Q/K/V/O, ALL PaliGemma layers (不做无依据的层区分)\\\\n- 每 expert ~3.7M params, 3 experts + router ≈ 12M total\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D007 | 2026-05-15 | Dream 审稿 4-5/10 Reject — 修复 plan 加入 rank-48 contro | phase0_activation_collection |\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-15 | PAR Router 改用 first-token pooling（F1 1.000 vs mean | phase0_activation_collection |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-15 | 进入 Research 阶段 — 完成 paper_framing.md + experiment_ | phase0_activation_collection |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-15 | Phase 0 GO — 核心假设验证通过，进入 Phase 1 LoRA expert 训练 | phase0_activation_collection |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-15 | Phase 0 架构修正：层索引改为 Gemma 2B 的 18 层范围 + 排除 Language | — |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-15 | 采纳 Reviewer 4 条建议增强 Phase 0：+binary sanity check,  | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-15 | MVP 定义为 Phase 0 early-kill gate：验证 π₀ 内部激活能否分类 3 类 | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2549, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01U2Ktz6qFgCU29M2M8WwFkW","session_id":"c8217637-8c12-424b-9256-3d9dc7b16457","uuid":"96ea4fc6-da78-4c98-92cb-c758c42f79bd","timestamp":"2026-05-15T18:19:20.417Z"}
