{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S5wLmH67wsKiD89MQDsXeD","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 meta_brain_lora_routing 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (5 个)\\n\\n- **phase1_spatial_demo_collection**: PREPARING — \\n- **phase1_physical_demo_collection**: PREPARING — \\n- **phase1_lora_visual**: PREPARING — \\n- **phase1_lora_universal_r16**: PREPARING — \\n- **phase0_activation_collection**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-15\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n（无）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **phase0_activation_collection** (success): —\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 1 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 1\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-34142: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n（无）\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01U7MtK2ysxK9CkCHdAttKmg","session_id":"c8217637-8c12-424b-9256-3d9dc7b16457","uuid":"cd95a6e4-246f-41b7-bdf9-081ddaf7b2a9","timestamp":"2026-05-15T18:19:39.508Z"}
