{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01A2GaQp1GgHdnTXJJj1SuEG","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttier: best\n2\tnarrative_guidance: 'Original framing holds without modification. Headline: \"Meta-Brain\n3\t  achieves 78.9% on LIBERO-Plus with ~12M params, outperforming parameter-matched\n4\t  rank-48 universal LoRA by 13.8pp — perturbation-diagnostic routing is a more efficient\n5\t  use of adaptation capacity than uniform correction.\" Ablation ladder strictly monotonic:\n6\t  Frozen (53.6) < Universal-r16 (62.4) < Universal-r48 (65.1) < Random (65.8) < Meta-Brain\n7\t  (78.9) < Oracle (80.7). Existential control (rank-48 universal) cleanly defeated.\n8\t  Random routing offers negligible gain over universal-r48 (+0.7pp, p=0.38, n.s.),\n9\t  ruling out ensemble effects. Oracle gap only 1.8pp, confirming PAR router quality.\n10\t  Clean LIBERO preserved (+0.3pp). Cross-type mismatch drop avg 17.4pp validates expert\n11\t  specialization. Rank sweep shows benefit monotonically increasing (13.8→13.9→14.2pp).\n12\t  All 3 claims stand at full strength. Paper structure: Phase 0 finding → architecture\n13\t  → ablation ladder → per-perturbation cross-type analysis → rank sweep → parameter\n14\t  efficiency. Bibliography covers MoE routing (Switch Transformer, GShard, ST-MoE,\n15\t  V-MoE), VLA robustness (VLA-GSE, SAFE, RobustVLA, FTM, FLA, SRPO, CorridorVLA),\n16\t  LoRA adaptation (LoRA, LoRA-SP, MoIRA, CORAL, AdaLoRA, DoRA), VLA foundations (pi0,\n17\t  OpenVLA, SmolVLA, Octo, RT-2), benchmarks (LIBERO, LIBERO-Plus), reaching 30+ refs\n18\t  comfortably.\n19\t\n20\t  '\n21\timagined_experiments:\n22\t- name: LoRA Expert Training — 3 Specialized + 1 Universal\n23\t  plan_id: plan_002\n24\t  description: 'Train 4 LoRA adapters (rank 16, Q/K/V/O on all 18 PaliGemma layers,\n25\t    3.7M params each): LoRA-V (online visual augmentation), LoRA-S (oracle spatial\n26\t    demos), LoRA-P (oracle physical demos), Universal (mixed all-perturbation data).\n27\t    Evaluate each expert on its matched type AND cross-type.\n28\t\n29\t    '\n30\t  expected_results:\n31\t    lora_v_on_visual: 80.2\n32\t    lora_v_on_spatial: 62.0\n33\t    lora_v_on_physical: 60.2\n34\t    lora_s_on_visual: 59.5\n35\t    lora_s_on_spatial: 77.5\n36\t    lora_s_on_physical: 60.0\n37\t    lora_p_on_visual: 58.2\n38\t    lora_p_on_spatial: 60.8\n39\t    lora_p_on_physical: 74.8\n40\t    universal_r16_visual: 64.8\n41\t    universal_r16_spatial: 60.5\n42\t    universal_r16_physical: 58.2\n43\t    universal_r16_overall: 62.4\n44\t    cross_type_avg_drop_pp: 17.4\n45\t    val_action_mse_lora_v: 0.0082\n46\t    val_action_mse_lora_s: 0.0091\n47\t    val_action_mse_lora_p: 0.0098\n48\t    val_action_mse_universal: 0.0105\n49\t    convergence_epochs: 15\n50\t  result_rationale: '在 best 档下，perturbation-specific LoRA 学到了质性不同的修正模式。LoRA-V 在 视觉扰动上达到"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01U2Ktz6qFgCU29M2M8WwFkW","session_id":"c8217637-8c12-424b-9256-3d9dc7b16457","uuid":"802357c3-232e-49af-8e04-6bf852e5b51b","timestamp":"2026-05-15T18:19:41.529Z"}
